        "Description": "47,\r\rWe&apos;ve been contracted by Our Lady of Big Money Bank to stop a heist in its tracks.  The notorious Animal Farm gang have already infiltrated the institution and are minutes from pulling off the 17th largest bank heist in the history of the tri-county area.  A heist of this magnitude could result in a small reduction in the bank manager&apos;s annual Christmas bonus, and that simply will not do.  Time to lead the animals to slaughter.",
